                  "rrtV2InlineElementsJson": null,
                  "html": null,
                  "text": null,
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Ms. Murillo, we only have one more week before the opening of our new bakery. I was considering running a last-minute advertisement in the Hudson Times.\\nB: I was thinking the same thing. I looked up their advertising rates this morning, and they seem reasonable. We have nearly two thousand dollars left in the marketing budget.\\nA: In that case, let’s get the largest ad that we can within our budget.\\nB: Okay. Should we use the same ad we used in the direct mail campaign?\\nA: Actually, that only had text, so I think this ad should be better with a picture of our store. Could you get one ready and send it to me?\"}]]}]]}"
